analsis.\nCorrectTESpec[spectra, dw, te, gyro, ppmRan] corrects the spectra \
for 1st order phase by extrapolating the missing FID samples in the TE using \
Henkel matrix SVD analsis. Only the part of the spectra in the ppmRan is used \
for optimization.", "Documentation" -> 
